{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f7c2b81-0c4e-4bc6-9a6f-3c8d0e5b1f2a",
    "name": "ÉLAN Homme — Backend",
    "description": "Complete Postman collection for the ÉLAN Homme backend (Express + TypeScript + MongoDB/Mongoose + Mollie payments).\n\nVariables: {{host}} (origin, default http://localhost:8085), {{baseUrl}} = {{host}}/api/v1. {{userAccessToken}} / {{adminAccessToken}} / {{providerAccessToken}} are auto-filled by the Login test scripts and used by protected requests. {{verifyEmailToken}} / {{resetPasswordToken}} are saved by Register / Forgot-Password scripts.\n\nAuth flow: POST /auth/register → save verificationToken from the response → confirm the 6-digit OTP from the inbox at POST /auth/verify-email (send the token via Authorization: Bearer) → POST /auth/login.\n\nAll module routes are now enabled in src/routes/index.ts: auth, user, setting, user-setting, upload, notification, payment, dashboard, balance and magazine. The subscription module exists under src/modules/subscription but is NOT mounted in the router yet — add it before testing those requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Signup, email verification (OTP + token), login, password management, logout & token refresh.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res?.data?.verificationToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('verifyEmailToken', res.data.verificationToken);",
                  "  console.log('verificationToken saved - check the inbox for the 6-digit OTP');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"phone\": \"+8801700000000\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8085/api/v1/auth/register",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ],
              "port": "8085"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Email",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res?.data?.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userAccessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  console.log('Email verified - access token saved (Login will set the role-specific token)');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{verifyEmailToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
